# Requests to exercise the API while debugging (Visual Studio / Rider / VS Code REST Client).
# Run the API with the "http" profile; the external service mock must be up (docker compose up -d external-service).

@api = http://localhost:5080
@mock = http://localhost:4000
@ssn = 345-67-8901

### 1. Submit an application (first time = create, again with the same SSN = update)
POST {{api}}/api/applications
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "firstName": "Ann",
  "lastName": "Lee",
  "ssn": "{{ssn}}",
  "companyName": "Acme",
  "requestedAmount": 25000,
  "street": "1 Main St",
  "city": "Austin",
  "state": "TX",
  "zipCode": "78701"
}

### 2. Make the external service fail the next N calls (transient 500s)
POST {{mock}}/admin/fail?count=10

### 3. Delivery status: pending, dead-lettered, oldest pending age
GET {{api}}/api/operations/events/status

### 4. Dead letters (copy an "id" for request 5)
GET {{api}}/api/operations/events/dead-letters

### 5. Requeue one dead letter
@deadLetterId = 1
POST {{api}}/api/operations/events/dead-letters/{{deadLetterId}}/requeue

### 6. Requeue every dead letter
POST {{api}}/api/operations/events/dead-letters/requeue

### 7. Health: Degraded while there are dead letters
GET {{api}}/health

### 8. What the external service received
GET {{mock}}/customers
